  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>As <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>&#62;</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> the required area is <math><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><msubsup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>e</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>e</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math>&nbsp;sq. units</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>e</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mi>a</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>e</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>e</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/></math></p>"
